# Subject: [PATCH v8 3/3] media: i2c: hm1092: Add ACPI enumeration and the 19.2 MHz configuration
# Date: 25 Oct 2026
# Review: under review. This is Jake Steinman's ACPI 19.2 MHz mode for Intel/Dell boards. Keep it so the file matches v8. The A16 should use the 24 MHz Qualcomm mode. The ipu-bridge HM1092 commit 4fdb0342f05e is Intel-only and is not carried.
# Apply: verbatim on linux-7.3 after the v8 driver file exists. It does not apply to a tree that still has the 4-argument get_selection from the next-20261012 rebase, until the v7.3 signature patch below.

